{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項涉及超過31.6萬名成年人的大型研究發現，一項常規血液檢查中的指標——血紅蛋白水平，可能為預測未來痴呆風險提供重要線索。研究人員發現，血紅蛋白水平過低或過高的人，在未來出現痴呆症的風險可能更高。這一發現意味着，醫生日常使用的血液檢查，或許能夠幫助科學家進一步理解身體健康狀況與長期腦部退化之間的聯繫。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584156.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.305608+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:37:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"8ab58179387d6c6c6e0dd2e5623b5916f600057fb8ca7718df1decd7def99b1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}